  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0 completes the capability-aware rendition, drawing, and presentation contract: semantic indexed/direct color resolution through Icod.TermInfo, controlled color and attribute degradation including ncv restrictions, italic/blink/conceal/strikeout rendition, a read-only presentation-capabilities view, semantic CursesLineGlyph cells, semantic window line/border overloads, ACS/Unicode/ASCII physical line rendering, lifecycle/disposal restoration acceptance, and warning-clean Staging validation. Dependencies remain Icod.Terminal 1.0.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0.",
